      <rich_text scale="h3">Testing Objective</rich_text>
      <rich_text>
Automated unit testing was conducted to verify the accuracy and reliability of the system's input validation methods.
The tests evaluated whether valid student information was accepted and invalid inputs were correctly rejected.

</rich_text>
      <rich_text scale="h3">Test Coverage</rich_text>
      <rich_text>
The 25 validator unit tests covered:
• </rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">Birthday Validation:</rich_text>
      <rich_text> Valid past dates and invalid future dates

• </rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">Required Fields:</rich_text>
      <rich_text> Empty, whitespace-only, and valid inputs

• </rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">Name Validation:</rich_text>
      <rich_text> Valid names, numbers, hyphens, apostrophes, and invalid characters

• </rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">BU Email Validation:</rich_text>
      <rich_text> Valid university emails and invalid addresses or domains

• </rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">Contact Number Validation:</rich_text>
      <rich_text> Valid 11-digit numbers, incorrect lengths, and invalid characters

• </rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">Student ID Validation:</rich_text>
      <rich_text> Correct format, missing values, letters, incorrect lengths, and whitespace


The latest test project also includes three additional GWA calculation test cases covering graded, ungraded, and mixed academic records.

</rich_text>
      <rich_text scale="h3">Automated Test Results</rich_text>
      <rich_text>
</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">Test Date:</rich_text>
      <rich_text> October 16, 2026
◇ </rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">Total Validator Tests:</rich_text>
      <rich_text> 25

◇ </rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">Passed:</rich_text>
      <rich_text> 25

◇ </rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">Failed:</rich_text>
      <rich_text> 0

◇ </rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">Skipped:</rich_text>
      <rich_text> 0

◇ </rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">Execution Time:</rich_text>
      <rich_text> 117 ms

◇ </rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">Recorded Result:</rich_text>
      <rich_text> PASS


All 25 validator tests returned the expected results during the recorded execution.
The three GWA test cases are included in the latest source code and are not counted in the October 16 execution results.

</rich_text>
