      <rich_text scale="h3">1. Retesting Overview</rich_text>
      <rich_text>
Bug retesting was conducted to verify corrections to student management, database integration, searching, and application functionality.
Ten issues were documented throughout the testing and integration process.

</rich_text>
      <rich_text scale="h3">2. Student Management Bug Results</rich_text>
      <rich_text>
</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">BUG-001: Existing Student Records Not Displayed</rich_text>
      <rich_text>
• Correction: Restored student retrieval and DataGridView loading.

• Retest Result: PASS

• Status: RESOLVED


</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">BUG-002: Add Student Does Not Save</rich_text>
      <rich_text>
◇ Correction: Integrated student creation with MySQL.

◇ Retest Result: PASS

◇ Status: RESOLVED


</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">BUG-003: Edit Student Not Working</rich_text>
      <rich_text>
◇ Correction: Implemented student record updates.

◇ Retest Result: PASS

◇ Status: RESOLVED


</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">BUG-004: Delete Student Not Working</rich_text>
      <rich_text>
◇ Correction: Implemented record deletion and confirmation.

◇ Retest Result: PASS

◇ Status: RESOLVED


</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">BUG-005: Student Search Not Working</rich_text>
      <rich_text>
◇ Correction: Implemented name and Student ID searching, partial matching, and filtering.

◇ Retest Result: PASS

◇ Status: RESOLVED



</rich_text>
      <rich_text scale="h3">3. Validation and Edit Mode Corrections</rich_text>
      <rich_text>
</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">BUG-006: Student ID Format Inconsistency</rich_text>
      <rich_text>
◇ Finding: Application validation and existing database Student ID formats were inconsistent.

◇ Recorded Status: OPEN


</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">BUG-007: Edit Mode After Deletion</rich_text>
      <rich_text>
◇ Finding: The application remained in Edit Mode after deletion.

◇ Correction: Added </rich_text>
      <rich_text family="monospace">ExitEditMode()</rich_text>
      <rich_text> to the deletion handler.

◇ Build Result: PASS

◇ Recorded Status: CORRECTION IMPLEMENTED



</rich_text>
      <rich_text scale="h3">4. Database and Integration Bug Results</rich_text>
      <rich_text>
</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">BUG-008: Missing Users Table</rich_text>
      <rich_text>
◇ Correction: Created the required </rich_text>
