      <rich_text scale="h3">7. Final Conclusion</rich_text>
      <rich_text>
Bug retesting demonstrated successful correction of the major student management and database integration issues identified during development.
The October 17 tests verified student CRUD, searching, and filtering. The October 22 integration tests confirmed successful application startup, registration, login, MySQL connectivity, dashboard loading, and student record retrieval.
The report records the implemented corrections and their respective verification results as part of the team's quality assurance documentation.
