</rich_text>
      <rich_text scale="h3">1. Testing Objective</rich_text>
      <rich_text>
Functional testing was conducted to evaluate student record management, input validation, database integration, editing, deletion, searching, and filtering.
Two rounds of testing were performed to identify initial issues and verify corrections.

</rich_text>
      <rich_text scale="h3">2. Functional Test Cases</rich_text>
      <rich_text>
</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">TC-01: Open Student Information Form</rich_text>
      <rich_text> — PASS
The student information form opened successfully.
</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">TC-02: Load Existing Students</rich_text>
      <rich_text> — PASS
Existing MySQL student records were displayed in the DataGridView.
</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">TC-03: Add Valid Student</rich_text>
      <rich_text> — PASS
A valid student record was saved and displayed.
</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">TC-04: Empty Student ID</rich_text>
      <rich_text> — PASS
The required-field warning appeared.
</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">TC-05: Invalid Student ID</rich_text>
      <rich_text> — PASS
The application displayed an invalid-format warning.
</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">TC-06: Empty Student Name</rich_text>
      <rich_text> — PASS
The required-name warning appeared.
</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">TC-07: Invalid Contact Number</rich_text>
      <rich_text> — PASS
Invalid contact information was rejected.
</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">TC-08: Duplicate Student ID</rich_text>
      <rich_text> — PASS
Duplicate Student ID validation prevented the duplicate entry.
</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">TC-09: Edit Existing Student</rich_text>
      <rich_text> — PASS
Changes were saved and verified in MySQL.
</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">TC-10: Confirm Student Deletion</rich_text>
      <rich_text> — PASS
The selected record was successfully deleted.
</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">TC-11: Cancel Student Deletion</rich_text>
      <rich_text> — PASS
The selected record remained unchanged.
</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">TC-12: Search Student by ID or Name</rich_text>
      <rich_text> — PASS
Matching student records were displayed.
</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">TC-13: Missing Program</rich_text>
      <rich_text> — PASS
The required-program warning appeared.
</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">TC-14: Missing Gender or Year Level</rich_text>
      <rich_text> — PASS
The appropriate selection warnings appeared.
</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">Recorded Round 2 Result: 14/14 PASS — October 17, 2026</rich_text>
      <rich_text>

</rich_text>
      <rich_text scale="h3">3. Testing Round Summary</rich_text>
      <rich_text>
</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">Round 1 — October 16, 2026</rich_text>
      <rich_text>
• Total Test Cases: 14

• Passed: 9

• Failed: 1

• Blocked: 4


</rich_text>
