      <rich_text>
◇ Total Test Cases: 14

◇ Passed: 14

◇ Failed: 0

◇ Blocked: 0


All 14 planned functional test cases passed during Round 2.

</rich_text>
      <rich_text scale="h3">4. Additional Functional Testing</rich_text>
      <rich_text>
The following scenarios were also successfully tested on October 17:
◇ Partial and case-insensitive searching

◇ Year Level and Program filtering

◇ Combined searching and filtering

◇ Clearing search and resetting filters

◇ Clear Selection behavior

◇ CSV export of displayed records

◇ CSV export with active search filters

◇ CSV export cancellation

◇ CSV export with no matching records


</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">Result:</rich_text>
      <rich_text> PASS for the recorded scenarios.

</rich_text>
      <rich_text scale="h3">5. Bug Retest Results</rich_text>
      <rich_text>
The following previously identified issues were corrected and successfully retested:
◇ BUG-001: Student records not displayed — RESOLVED

◇ BUG-002: Add Student database integration — RESOLVED

◇ BUG-003: Edit Student functionality — RESOLVED

◇ BUG-004: Delete Student functionality — RESOLVED

◇ BUG-005: Student Search functionality — RESOLVED


Additional validation and Edit Mode findings were recorded in the separate Bug Retest Update document.

</rich_text>
      <rich_text scale="h3">6. Final Integration Verification</rich_text>
      <rich_text>
</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">Test Date:</rich_text>
      <rich_text> October 22, 2026
◇ Solution Build: PASS (2 projects succeeded, 0 failed)

◇ Application Startup: PASS

◇ Login Required-Field Validation: PASS

◇ MySQL Connection: PASS

◇ User Registration: PASS

◇ User Login: PASS

◇ Dashboard Loading: PASS

◇ Student Record Retrieval: PASS


</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">Verified Database Records:</rich_text>
      <rich_text> 2 students
</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">Dashboard Results:</rich_text>
      <rich_text>
◇ Total Students: 2

◇ Total Subjects: 0

◇ Total Enrollments: 0

◇ Ungraded Enrollments: 0


