</rich_text>
      <rich_text scale="h3">7. Final Testing Conclusion</rich_text>
      <rich_text>
The SchemaX Student Information System completed two documented rounds of functional testing.
Initial database integration issues were identified during Round 1 and corrected before Round 2. All 14 planned functional test cases passed on October 17.
Additional testing confirmed searching, filtering, Clear Selection behavior, and CSV export functionality. The October 22 integration session also verified successful application startup, user authentication, MySQL connectivity, dashboard loading, and student record retrieval.
</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">Final Recorded Functional Test Result:</rich_text>
      <rich_text> PASS — 14/14
</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">Latest Integration Verification:</rich_text>
